OL,3,GNEWSAWoman pleads guilty to banned XL
OL,4,Abully charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fpossessing two XL bullies and causing
OL,8,Funnecessary suffering to three other
OL,9,Fdogs.
OL,11,FAppearing at Sheffield Magistrates'
OL,12,FCourt earlier, Amini Ato pleaded guilty
OL,13,Fto possessing the banned dog and
OL,14,Fcausing unnecessary suffering to a
OL,15,Fbull-type dog.
OL,17,FShe had already pleaded guilty to two
OL,18,Fcounts of causing unnecessary suffering
OL,19,Fto a female American bulldog and an
OL,20,Felderly German Shepherd dog.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
