OL,3,GNEWSAWoman pleads guilty to banned XL
OL,4,Abully charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FAto, 50, of Middle Hay Place,
OL,7,FSheffield, was told she would be
OL,8,Fsentenced on 19 October and that "all
OL,9,Fsentencing options would remain open",
OL,10,Fincluding a custodial sentence or
OL,11,Fsending the case to crown court.
